                      <LENGTH>8</LENGTH>
                      <I-PDU-TIMING-SPECIFICATIONS>
                        <I-PDU-TIMING>
                          <MINIMUM-DELAY>0.2</MINIMUM-DELAY>
                          <TRANSMISSION-MODE-DECLARATION>
                            <TRANSMISSION-MODE-TRUE-TIMING>
                              <CYCLIC-TIMING>
                                <DESC>
                                  <L-2 L="DE">Weiters erfolgt die Versendung zyklisch mit einer großen Periode (Bus aktiv).</L-2>
                                  <L-2 L="EN">The message is also sent cyclically with a large period when the bus is active.</L-2>
                                </DESC>
                                <TIME-PERIOD>
                                  <TOLERANCE>
                                    <ABSOLUTE-TOLERANCE>
                                      <ABSOLUTE>2</ABSOLUTE>
                                    </ABSOLUTE-TOLERANCE>
                                  </TOLERANCE>
                                  <VALUE>10</VALUE>
                                </TIME-PERIOD>
                              </CYCLIC-TIMING>
                              <EVENT-CONTROLLED-TIMING>
                                <DESC>
                                  <L-2 L="DE">Die Nachricht wird - ab Bus aktiv - bei jeder Signaländerung versandt.
Um eine Versendung auszulösen, müssen sich die Inhalte der Signale Wegstrecke_Kilometer bzw. Reichweite um mindestens 2 Kilometer von der letzten verschickten Nachricht unterscheiden.</L-2>
                                  <L-2 L="EN">When the bus is active the message is sent at each change of the signal contents.
Concerning the signal 'mileage_kilometer' it it defined that the new content of the signal has to be at least 2 kilometers greater than the last message that was sent.</L-2>
                                </DESC>
                                <NUMBER-OF-REPETITIONS>0</NUMBER-OF-REPETITIONS>
                              </EVENT-CONTROLLED-TIMING>
                            </TRANSMISSION-MODE-TRUE-TIMING>
                          </TRANSMISSION-MODE-DECLARATION>
                        </I-PDU-TIMING>
                      </I-PDU-TIMING-SPECIFICATIONS>
